								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"post-bill"
							]
						},
						"description": "Create a new bill request for bundle subscriptions. The bill amount is automatically calculated based on the vehicle's body type and bundle type from the price list.\n\n**Required Fields:**\n- bill_desc: Description of the bill\n- phone: Phone number of the account holder\n- account_no: Account number (must exist in account table)\n- vehicle_id: Vehicle ID (must exist in vehicle table)\n- plate_no: Vehicle plate number (must match vehicle_id)\n- bundle_id: Bundle type (1=daily, 2=weekly, 3=monthly)\n\n**Note:** The bill_amount is automatically calculated from the price list."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
